    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deck-Based Dungeon Crawler!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find cool cards, create epic combos, and explore the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/0a9effe935d7f74dd76ad8fa433f9f90.avif?t=1746335213\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Deck takes the classic roguelike dungeon crawler, with a twist. The dungeon you are exploring is in the form of a deck of cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/126d5fdd5fcf7d3a6843495eca23b2ca.poster.avif?t=1746335213\" width=564 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/126d5fdd5fcf7d3a6843495eca23b2ca.webm?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/126d5fdd5fcf7d3a6843495eca23b2ca.mp4?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right cards for your deck will massively impact your chances \u2013 only certain cards work well together! Visit the peaceful Meadows, a creepy Forest, or even an exotic Beach! Face fun critters and discover unique encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/c7cca92a2a8d948cf9486aea01b60f6a.poster.avif?t=1746335213\" width=564 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/c7cca92a2a8d948cf9486aea01b60f6a.webm?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/c7cca92a2a8d948cf9486aea01b60f6a.mp4?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/7eb9356e1fed090d97ce0fdd37ab632a.avif?t=1746335213\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix and match cards</strong> and discover combos that are unstoppable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock unique weapons</strong> with fun effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face a variety of enemies</strong>, each with a unique challenge to beat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new deck every time!</strong> Face the unexpected with a randomly created deck of cards, and discover different items and events every time you play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/f7956b08b9ec8be97146272bb8d304a7.poster.avif?t=1746335213\" width=564 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/f7956b08b9ec8be97146272bb8d304a7.webm?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/f7956b08b9ec8be97146272bb8d304a7.mp4?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community and share your feedback - our developers visit every day!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deck-Based Dungeon Crawler!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find cool cards, create epic combos, and explore the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/0a9effe935d7f74dd76ad8fa433f9f90.avif?t=1746335213\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Deck takes the classic roguelike dungeon crawler, with a twist. The dungeon you are exploring is in the form of a deck of cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/126d5fdd5fcf7d3a6843495eca23b2ca.poster.avif?t=1746335213\" width=564 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/126d5fdd5fcf7d3a6843495eca23b2ca.webm?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/126d5fdd5fcf7d3a6843495eca23b2ca.mp4?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the right cards for your deck will massively impact your chances \u2013 only certain cards work well together! Visit the peaceful Meadows, a creepy Forest, or even an exotic Beach! Face fun critters and discover unique encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/c7cca92a2a8d948cf9486aea01b60f6a.poster.avif?t=1746335213\" width=564 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/c7cca92a2a8d948cf9486aea01b60f6a.webm?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/c7cca92a2a8d948cf9486aea01b60f6a.mp4?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/7eb9356e1fed090d97ce0fdd37ab632a.avif?t=1746335213\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix and match cards</strong> and discover combos that are unstoppable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock unique weapons</strong> with fun effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face a variety of enemies</strong>, each with a unique challenge to beat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new deck every time!</strong> Face the unexpected with a randomly created deck of cards, and discover different items and events every time you play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/f7956b08b9ec8be97146272bb8d304a7.poster.avif?t=1746335213\" width=564 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/f7956b08b9ec8be97146272bb8d304a7.webm?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895110/extras/f7956b08b9ec8be97146272bb8d304a7.mp4?t=1746335213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community and share your feedback - our developers visit every day!</p>",
